sequenceDiagram
    participant Model as LLM 模型
    participant Agent as Agent Runtime
    participant T1 as Tool: Read A
    participant T2 as Tool: Read B
    participant T3 as Tool: Read C

    Note over Model,Agent: 模型开始流式输出
    Model->>Agent: 文本块："好的，我来帮你看一下..."

    rect rgba(78, 201, 176, 0.12)
        Note right of Model: 边说边执行模式
        Model-->>Agent: tool_call_1 (Read A) 完成
        Agent->>T1: 立即执行 Read A
        Model-->>Agent: tool_call_2 (Read B) 完成
        Agent->>T2: 立即执行 Read B
        T1-->>Agent: A 的结果返回
        Model-->>Agent: tool_call_3 (Read C) 完成
        Agent->>T3: 立即执行 Read C
        T2-->>Agent: B 的结果返回
        T3-->>Agent: C 的结果返回
    end

    Note over Model: 所有 tool_call 生成完毕
    Model->>Agent: 分析结果，输出总结
